    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2024_0589","fieldKey":"description"} -->
    <Description>Ulla Whitehorse talks about how to hang a painting upside down on purpose. Recorded while the artist repainted the studio wall the same white, four times.</Description>
